    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By prioritizing clauses that require compliance with all relevant regulatory requirements, including those related to AI and data protection, our company's can ensure that our company's legal standing and procurement experience align with the tender requirements, while also demonstrating our company's commitment to regulatory compliance and data sovereignty." ;
