        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our also have a minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate The global budget for the project, our first need to determine the total revenue from this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for the project is 3,000,000 euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can secure The global budget for the project as our revenue, our target margin would be 28% of 3,000,000 euros, which equals 840,000 euros. our minimum acceptable margin would be 18% of 3,000,000 euros, which equals 540,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, our could propose absorbing costs via rate renegotiation with subcontractors if The global budget for the project is reduced by up to 10 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For larger reductions, our might need to reduce scope or remove optional modules and training days to maintain viability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information on the project specifics and how our pricing model applies to this contract, it's difficult to provide a precise cost-optimization plan. our would need to carefully consider the fixed and variable costs associated with the project, which are generally split at 35% fixed and 65% variable for our projects.  our standard daily rates for various roles could be adjusted or optimized based on the specific needs of the project and the client's requirements, potentially allowing for some flexibility in cost management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, any proposal must align with our minimum acceptable margin to ensure the project viability for our." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval seeks a solution that improves the quality of answers, reduces processing times, and assists agents in agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy would you recommend to meet these objectives, considering our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, and past AI use cases?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address these objectives, I recommend leveraging our company's Large Language Model (LLM) expertise, particularly with our company's preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct has demonstrated strong performance in French-language tasks, which is essential given The City of Belval likely language requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, to improve the quality of answers, our company's can employ our company's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating RAG with our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, our company's can enhance our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct ability to provide accurate and relevant responses by retrieving information from a knowledge base of internal procedures, regulatory texts, and other relevant documents. our company's experience with vector stores like Qdrant and Weaviate will be crucial in efficiently managing and querying a knowledge base of internal procedures, regulatory texts, and other relevant documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times, our company's can utilize our company's expertise in model quantization methods such as INT8 and INT4 (GPTQ). model quantization methods such as INT8 and INT4 (GPTQ) can significantly decrease the computational resources required for inference without substantial performance degradation, allowing for faster response times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's experience with fine-tuning methods like LoRA and QLoRA can help adapt our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to the specific tone and format of administrative documents, further improving efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assisting agents in agents daily missions requires a user-centric approach. our company's can draw from our company's past AI use cases, such as the regulatory document Q&A assistant for public administration and the clinical guideline assistant for healthcare practitioners. our past AI use cases, such as the regulatory document Q&A assistant for public administration and the clinical guideline assistant for healthcare practitioners have taught us the importance of accessibility, explicability, and transparency in AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, we should focus on developing an intelligent assistance tool that is not only capable of providing high-quality answers but also offers explanations for its responses, aligning with our explainability and trust practices. our company's innovation strategy should involve a phased deployment, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope to test the solution's effectiveness and gather feedback from agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our innovation strategy will allow our company's to refine the solution's before progressively generalizing the solution's to all services, ensuring minimal disruption to existing workflows and maximizing user adoption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and strategies, our company's can develop an effective solution that meets these objectives while leveraging our company's strengths in LLMs, RAG, and AI innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint by reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we contribute to aims through we proposed solution, and what sustainability trade-offs should we consider in we bid?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can assure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to reducing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can contribute to aims by proposing a solution that relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact, such as Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices, including model quantisation, auto-scaling, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can also help reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. estimate that Our digital sobriety practices, including model quantisation, auto-scaling, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy can lead to a typical energy reduction of around 35% compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. must consider sustainability trade-offs in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. bid." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. high availability requirement may conflict with reducing energetic consumption, as our high availability requirement may require warm standby nodes that consume energy continuously." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a standard resolution for this tension, which involves using low-power standby mode with a wake-up time of less than 90 seconds, accepted as SLA-compatible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another trade-off could be the performance versus model size, where larger models deliver higher accuracy but consume more energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate Another trade-off, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. prefer quantised mid-size models with fine-tuning over large unoptimised models, which can help balance performance and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By considering sustainability trade-offs and proposing a solution that incorporates Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmentally friendly practices, we can contribute to The City of Belval goal of reducing The City of Belval environmental footprint while also meeting The City of Belval requirements for high availability and performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

