        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., is pleased to submit a proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval. an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval will improve the efficiency of administrative services and enhance the quality of service rendered to users. the City of Belval digital transformation strategy aims to leverage technology to improve public services, and Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., is well-equipped to support aims." ;
