    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Società a responsabilità limitata (S.r.l.) registered in Italy, our company's have ensured that our company's have no exclusion grounds, including no criminal convictions, outstanding tax or social security irregularities, grave professional misconduct, conflicts of interest, and are not subject to insolvency or liquidation proceedings." ;
