    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, our company's is familiar with GDPR, as evidenced by our company's standard legal basis for data processing being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. our company's also have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2, which ensures that our company's can guarantee strict compliance with GDPR." ;
