    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for the principle of sovereignty of data, our company's understand the importance of ensuring that data is hosted and processed within the European Union. our company's subcontracting policy requires that all subcontractors be the European Union-established, which aligns with requires." ;
