    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of procurement experience, our company's has experience working with public contracts in Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and the European Union institutions, including open procedures, restricted procedures, competitive dialogue, and framework agreements. our company's have won a total of 31 public contracts, with the largest contract being €4,500,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the requirement that no decision can be automated without explicit validation by an agent, our company's should prioritize contractual clauses related to human oversight and validation. our company's AI regulatory knowledge includes expertise in EU AI Act, prohibited AI practices awareness, limited risk AI transparency obligations, and human oversight contractual enforcement. our company's also have a policy of no automated decision-making without human validation." ;
